*** 26.1.0 features

- To assist in debugging, added :subcom:`min_condor_version` and
  :subcom:`max_condor_version`, which prevent the require the HTCondor
  version of the EP to greater than or equal to, or strictly less than,
  respectively, the specified version, e.g. "26.0.1".
  :jira:`3065`

